From: Agente-Builder <cercano-dev@local>
Subject: [PATCH] fix(client): chat Flutter compila en Windows (import de bind, Colors.green, CrossAxisAlignment)
Date: 2026-11-26
Component: vendor/client
Task: F3-17

El parche 009 dejo tres errores de Dart que rompian flutter build windows:
